<p>Israel said it had begun what it called “limited and targeted ground operations” against Hezbollah positions in southern Lebanon on March 16, a sharp escalation in fighting along the border. Several reports described the move as an expansion of Israeli military action in southern Lebanon, as Israeli strikes also hit towns in the south. The operation followed Hezbollah missile fire into Israel and came amid the broader regional war involving Iran, Israel and the United States, according to the cited reports. Canada, France, Germany, Italy and the United Kingdom publicly urged Israel not to launch a significant ground offensive, warning that it could bring devastating humanitarian consequences and a prolonged conflict. The same leaders condemned Hezbollah attacks, backed efforts by Lebanon’s government to disarm Hezbollah, and expressed solidarity with Lebanese civilians, underscoring an ongoing diplomatic push for de-escalation and negotiations even as the conflict widens.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Ee19FDP6qx6FeYSq08cQP0DK5oWOo6xEFsV3XBr4DUHLqlG_cPi9f8bKSXy_A0Z0_5fpm2aoIuww-9neaejwEJJyGFfOtTsT1FWR2I_wWuTuq28vn4eDOcvt1uIpWI_HkLEazfd8WR-nNAv8g3KcHzoqVNezC_grrY1C7i4vQXhYiplsiddb_6ocEmVOudDToJL_iraPksTh4jACyhvgLHr0bX45J63Gb9e5YUcE0NQBR2gfi_xlY0LbgUrcbJwUX5MmDwk3ZQvnRSFRnA' alt='Smoke plumes rise following Israeli bombardment on the village of Khiam in southern Lebanon near the border with Israel, as seen from nearby Marjayoun, on March 16, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Civilian toll: Politico reported that Israeli bombardments in Lebanon have killed more than 800 people since March 3, including more than 100 children, citing local media.</li><li>Mass displacement: More than 1 million people have been displaced in Lebanon, according to Reuters figures cited by Politico, showing how far the disruption extends beyond the front lines.</li><li>Timing of diplomacy: Politico said the five-country warning came late Monday evening, after Israel had announced the start of ground operations earlier that day.</li></ul><blockquote>A significant Israeli ground offensive would have devastating humanitarian consequences and could lead to a protracted conflict. It must be averted. - Leaders of Canada, France, Germany, Italy and the U.K.</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Israeli military: The Israel Defense Forces said it had begun “limited and targeted ground operations” against what it described as key Hezbollah strongholds in southern Lebanon. (<a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/europe-leaders-warns-israel-over-ground-offensive-lebanon/'>Politico Europe</a>)</li><li>Canada, France, Germany, Italy and the U.K.: The five governments said Israel should avoid a significant ground offensive and called for de-escalation, immediate peace talks and a political solution. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-israel-invasion-southern-lebanon-hezbollah-fighters/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li><li>Western leaders on Lebanon: The joint statement said Lebanon’s government and people had been drawn into the conflict against their will, and it backed Beirut’s efforts to disarm Hezbollah. (<a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/europe-leaders-warns-israel-over-ground-offensive-lebanon/'>Politico Europe</a>)</li><li>WSWS: The outlet described the operation as a long-planned invasion aimed at seizing the area south of the Litani River, a broader characterization than the limited-operation language used by Israel. (<a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/03/17/yvdv-m17.html'>WSWS</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/03/17/yvdv-m17.html'>Israel begins its long-planned ground invasion of Lebanon</a> - wsws.org</li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/shorts/F8Pk8jijkgM'>Israeli strikes hit southern Lebanese town • FRANCE 24 English</a> - youtube.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/canada-france-germany-uk-warn-against-major-israeli-ground-offensive-in-lebanon'>‘Significant’ Israeli ground offensive in Lebanon ‘must be averted’: Western leaders’ statement</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/canada-france-germany-uk-warn-against-major-israeli-ground-offensive-in-lebanon/article70751546.ece'>Canada, France, Germany, U.K. warn against major Israeli ground offensive in Lebanon</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-israel-invasion-southern-lebanon-hezbollah-fighters/'>Israel expands its ground invasion of southern Lebanon</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/europe-leaders-warns-israel-over-ground-offensive-lebanon/'>European leaders warn Israel against ground offensive in Lebanon</a> - politico.eu</li></ul>